msgid ""
"Delete the host's certificate and re-generate it upon restart. Requires the "
"app to be fully restarted. NOTE: this will make the device unable to connect "
"with previously connected devices. You must unpair this device from the "
"other remote devices and pair them again."
msgstr ""
"Izbriši potrdilo gostitelja in ga ponovno ustvari ob ponovnem zagonu. "
"Zahteva, da se aplikacija v celoti znova zažene. OPOMBA: zaradi tega se "
"naprava ne bo mogla povezati s prej povezanimi napravami. To napravo morate "
"razdružiti z drugimi oddaljenimi napravami in jih znova združiti."

