msgid ""
"If KDE Connect is having trouble discovering other devices, you can try a "
"combination of the following solutions:\n"
"\n"
"1. \"Refresh Discovery\" through the %@ menu or pull to refresh the Devices "
"list, on this and the other devices.\n"
"\n"
"2. Make sure the other devices are also running KDE Connect and are "
"connected to the same network as this device.\n"
"\n"
"3. Manually add the other devices through the \"Configure Devices By IP\" "
"option in the %@ menu, and then \"Refresh Discovery.\"\n"
"\n"
"4. Check other solutions on the User Manual, such as configuring the "
"firewalls of the other devices:\n"
msgstr ""
"Če ima KDE Connect težave z odkrivanjem drugih naprav, lahko poskusite s "
"kombinacijo naslednjih rešitev: \n"
"\n"
"1. Izvedite \"Osveži odkrivanje\" prek menija %@ ali povlecite seznam naprav "
"navzdol, da ga osvežite – tako na tej kot na drugih napravah.\n"
"\n"
"2. Prepričajte se, da tudi na drugih napravah teče KDE Connect in da so "
"povezane v isto omrežje kot ta naprava.\n"
"\n"
"3. Druge naprave ročno dodajte prek možnosti \"Konfiguriraj naprave prek IP-"
"ja\" v meniju %@ in nato izberite \"Osveži odkrivanje\".\n"
"\n"
"4. Preverite druge rešitve v uporabniškem priročniku, na primer "
"konfiguracijo vdorobranov na drugih napravah:\n"

msgid ""
"If a remembered device is already online but not shown here, try Refresh "
"Discovery."
msgstr ""
"Če je shranjena naprava že povezana, a ni prikazana tukaj, poskusite z "
"možnostjo \"Osveži odkrivanje\"."

msgid ""
"If there are phantom devices or something just doesn't behave correctly, "
"erasing all saved devices data might fix it. Requires the app to be fully "
"restarted."
msgstr ""
"Če so prisotne »fantomske« naprave ali kaj ne deluje pravilno, lahko težavo "
"odpravite z brisanjem vseh shranjenih podatkov o napravah. Za to je potreben "
"popoln ponovni zagon aplikacije."

